abstract: >-
  A transparent Python research laboratory spanning validated galaxy
  rotation-curve and compact-object analysis, preregistered catalogue-level
  celestial-node falsification through UFF-SLFA, and survey-aware adversarial
  evaluation through the Sheridan Crucible. The software provides frozen
  machine-readable contracts, deterministic null models, survey masks and
  completeness, spherical von Mises-Fisher density reconstruction,
  nuisance-model comparison, injection calibration, SHA-256 evidence bundles,
  public-claim provenance, and numerical replay. These controls establish
  computational consistency and calibrated catalogue-level tests; they do not
  establish a physical ontology or validate an extraordinary causal claim.
